message: "If you use or adapt this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Safe Streets Addis: a privacy-first road safety system for Addis Ababa"
version: "0.3"
date-released: "2026-11-20"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/DrTemesgen/safe-streets-addis"
url: "https://drtemesgen.com/proposals/safe-streets-addis"
type: dataset
abstract: "An open, citizen proposal (draft for discussion) for privacy-first, AI-assisted speed and red-light enforcement for every vehicle in Addis Ababa (taxis and fleets are one extra layer), built on existing city cameras, new RFID/QR number plates and digital fine payment, with human review of every case, centrally set location-specific speed limits, a signed audit trail and a lean warning-only pilot. Road safety as preventive medicine."
keywords:
  - road safety
  - Addis Ababa
  - Ethiopia
  - speed enforcement
  - AI traffic enforcement
  - privacy by design
  - Safe System
  - preventive medicine
authors:
